<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis stock dividend H1 96.</title>
<headline>Fortis stock dividend H1 96.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch-Belgian financial group Fortis said on Thursday that the interim dividend for H1 1996 of 0.68 guilders per share would be payable either wholly in cash or wholly in shares.</p>
<p>&quot;Where shareholders have opted to receive the dividend in shares, 78 dividend entitlements will entitle the holder to one new share,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>&quot;The number of dividend intitlements that will entitle shareholders to one new share (or depositary receipt) as was announced previously, has now been set on the basis of the closing price for the depositary receipts for shares of Fortis Amev on the Amsterdam stock exchange on September 25,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Fortis Amev closed at 50.70 guilders yesterday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
